 Mexico Beach from 20 to\n60 NM...\n\n* Until 730 AM CDT.\n\n* At 555 AM CDT, strong thunderstorms were located along a line\nextending from 8 nm southeast of Highway 331 Bridge to 17 nm east\nof Okaloosa Deep Water Reef, moving east at 15 knots.\n\nHAZARD...Wind gusts 34 knots or greater.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Expect wind gusts in excess of 34 knots...suddenly higher\nwaves...frequent lightning...and heavy downpours. Make\nsure all on board are wearing life jackets.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nPanama City Beach, Laguna Beach, Mexico Beach, and Santa Rosa\nBeach.","instruction":"Move to safe harbor until hazardous weather passes.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["SMWTAE"],"WMOidentifier":["WHUS52 KTAE 011055"],"eventMotionDescription":["2026-08-01T10:55:00-00:00...storm...284DEG...16KT...30.29,-86.1 29.94,-86.18"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.NEW.KTAE.MA.W.0268.260801T1055Z-260801T1230Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-01T07:30:00-05:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["SMW"],"NationalWeatherService":["MAW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.7ba1f287abb4b900fa791efd10f9e96fcc507b5b.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-98.33,28.43],[-98.08,28.5],[-97.86,28.15],[-97.94,28.1],[-98.15,28.36],[-98.33,28.33],[-98.33,28.43]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.7ba1f287abb4b900fa791efd10f9e96fcc507b5b.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.7ba1f287abb4b900fa791efd10f9e96fcc507b5b.001.1","areaDesc":"Live Oak, TX","geocode":{"SAME":["048297"],"UGC":["TXC297"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/TXC297"],"references":[{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a7baff553c95b209282975fe25e7894797faf8a6.001.1","identifier":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a7baff5